    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This Procurement Policy Note (PPN) sets out information and guidance to central government departments, their executive agencies and non-departmental public bodies on the use of procurement cards. The aim is to accelerate payments to suppliers to support and improve cash flow. This will help support the economy, jobs and infrastructure.",
